ength > maxChars && q > 0.5) {\n    q = Math.round((q - 0.08) * 100) / 100;\n    out = canvas.toDataURL(\"image/jpeg\", q);\n  }\n  return out;\n}\n","message":"Wrote contents to /Users/naoryanko/kiss/kiss/src/lib/jpeg.ts"}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"toolu_01KTHTZ576UEU2hqfXhHHDZ2","startedAtMs":"1790662877309","completedAtMs":"1790662879065"},"model_call_id":"efcc917a-a88a-45b2-852e-f591dfa7e0c7-30-j1pu","session_id":"048e4607-7507-4c09-84b1-b33f77e5e581","timestamp_ms":1790662884682}
